{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受偏強西南風及低壓帶影響，台灣台南、高雄一帶清晨下暴雨，多區嚴重水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">高雄清晨起下大暴雨，風雨下路邊樹木不停搖晃，大量積水從路邊綠化帶湧到路面，道路水浸，汽車駛過濺起大量水花。部分地段水浸最深處一度超過30厘米。有食肆天光後忙於清理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026PTl2v0mtw81787462494.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">台南同樣下暴雨，並引發水浸。仁德區中山路附近一度水深至膝蓋，小巷變成澤國。位處地下層的民居，家電家具都被水淹浸。當局在水深區域設警戒線，又封鎖道路，防止汽車及路人有危險。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026KQ7cigWKbu1787462507.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">永康區同樣嚴重水浸，有商舖設置防水閘，但阻擋不了積水湧入。當區一度發出警報，指水深超過30厘米。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_004.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20264W5m5wkuK71787462547.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1300_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受暴雨影響，屏東縣、台南市與高雄市先後宣布停工停課。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T05:38:05.946984+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}